This repository is submitted coursework for the "AI Agent Orchestration" final
project at the University of Haifa, under Dr. Yoram Segal's instruction.

Permission is granted to the course instructional staff to view, execute,
clone, and evaluate this repository for grading and academic purposes.

This project reuses architectural patterns (module layout, config-split
convention) from the publicly documented reference simulator
https://github.com/rmisegal/Game-P2P-Cop-Chase, per its own stated terms
("a learning aid... you may read it to understand how a piece is
implemented and reuse parts") and the course's explicit permission to reuse
parts of that code. No source code from that repository was copied
verbatim; only its documented structure and conventions were adapted.

